ion], remember Allāh and seek forgiveness for their sins - and who can forgive sins except Allāh? - and [who] do not persist in what they have done while they know.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":135,"sd":null},{"k":"3:136","t":"Those - their reward is forgiveness from their Lord and gardens beneath which rivers flow [in Paradise], wherein they will abide eternally; and excellent is the reward of the [righteous] workers.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":136,"sd":null},{"k":"3:137","t":"Similar situations [as yours] have passed on before you, so proceed throughout the earth and observe how was the end of those who denied.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":137,"sd":null},{"k":"3:138","t":"This [Qur’ān] is a clear statement to [all] the people and a guidance and instruction for those conscious of Allāh.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":138,"sd":null},{"k":"3:139","t":"So do not weaken and do not grieve, and you will be superior if you are [true] believers.","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":139,"sd":null},{"k":"3:140","t":"If a wound should touch you - there has already touched the [opposing] people a wound similar to it. And these days [of varying conditions] We alternate among the people so that Allāh may make evident those who believe and [may] take to Himself from among you martyrs - and Allāh does not like the wrongdoers -","j":4,"h":7,"s":3,"a":140,"sd":null}],"juz":4,"hizb":7,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}